eman taimako idan mutum ba shi da lafiya. Kasuwa wuri ne da ake saye da sayarwa. [PAUSE 1] Ina ake karatu a cikin al’umma? [MAIN] Ka haɗa darasin da abin da kake gani a gida, makaranta, kasuwa, ko unguwa. Ka yi tunani a hankali, ka nuna ladabi, sannan ka tambayi babba idan kana bukatar ƙarin bayani. [PAUSE 2] Ina ake saye da sayarwa? [OUTRO] Ka ci gaba da lura da rayuwar al’umma. Kyakkyawan hali yana taimaka maka ka zauna lafiya da mutane.\",\n    \"audioFile\": \"audio/p2-socs-05.mp3\",\n    \"imageCard\": \"images/p2-socs-05.png\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Ina ake karatu a cikin al’umma?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"makaranta\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"makaranta\",\n          \"kasuwa\",\n          \"filin wasa\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Ina ake saye da sayarwa?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"kasuwa\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"asibiti\",\n          \"kasuwa\",\n          \"ɗaki\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"quizQuestions\": [\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Ina ake karatu a cikin al’umma?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"makaranta\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"kasuwa\",\n          \"filin wasa\",\n          \"hanya\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Ina ake saye da sayarwa?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"kasuwa\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"asibiti\",\n          \"ɗaki\",\n          \"allo\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Ina ake neman taimako idan mutum ba shi da lafiya?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"asibiti\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"kasuwa\",\n          \"filin wasa\",\n          \"madubi\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me ya kamata ka nuna a wurin jama’a?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"ladabi\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"hayaniya\",\n          \"tsokana\",\n          \"ƙin tsari\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me bai dace ka zubar a hanya ba?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"shara\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"gaisuwa\",\n          \"ladabi\",\n          \"taimako\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"track\": \"formal\",\n    \"targetAudience\": \"youth\",\n    \"gapTeaser\": null,\n    \"chainNext\": null,\n    \"isChainLeaf\": true,\n    \"useTodayPrompt\": null\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-socs-06\",\n    \"gradeband\": \"p2\",\n    \"subject\": \"Social Studies\",\n    \"subjectHa\": \"Nazarin Zamantakewa\",\n    \"moduleNumber\": 6,\n    \"titleEn\": \"Occupations\",\n    \"titleHa\": \"Sana’o’i\",\n    \"titleAjami\": null,\n    \"ajami_validated\": false,\n    \"textExplanationHa\": \"Sana’a ita ce aikin da mutum yake yi domin ya taimaki kansa, iyali, da al’umma. A unguwa za ka iya ganin malami, likita, manomi, masunci, tela, direba, mai gyaran takalma, ko ɗan kasuwa. Kowane aiki yana da amfani. Malami yana koyar da yara. Likita yana taimaka wa marasa lafiya. Manomi yana noma abinci. Tela yana ɗinka tufafi. Direba yana kai mutane wurare cikin kulawa. Ya kamata ka girmama masu sana’a saboda aikinsu yana taimaka wa rayuwa ta gudana. Kada ka raina aikin mutum. Idan ka girma, kai ma za ka iya koyon sana’a mai kyau. Ka lura da mutanen da ke aiki a kusa da kai, ka tambayi babba sunan aikinsu cikin ladabi. Ka sake duba misali a gida ko makaranta, sannan ka faɗa wa babba abin da ka koya.\",\n    \"textExplanationAjami\": null,\n    \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin Zamantakewa. Yau za mu koyi Sana’o’i. [MAIN] Sana’a ita ce aikin da mutum yake yi domin ya taimaki kansa, iyali, da al’umma. A unguwa za ka iya ganin malami, likita, manomi, masunci, tela, direba, mai gyaran takalma, ko ɗan kasuwa. Kowane aiki yana da amfani. Malami yana koyar da yara. [PAUSE 1] Wane ne yake koyar da yara? [MAIN] Ka haɗa darasin da abin da kake gani a gida, makaranta, kasuwa, ko unguwa. Ka yi tunani a hankali, ka nuna ladabi, sannan ka tambayi babba idan kana bukatar ƙarin bayani. [PAUSE 2] Me manomi yake yi? [OUTRO] Ka ci gaba da lura da rayuwar al’umma. Kyakkyawan hali yana taimaka maka ka zauna lafiya da mutane.\",\n    \"audioFile\": \"audio/p2-socs-06.mp3\",\n    \"imageCard\": \"images/p2-socs-06.png\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Wane ne yake koyar da yara?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"malami\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"malami\",\n          \"direba\",\n          \"tela\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Me manomi yake yi?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"noma abinci\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"noma abinci\",\n          \"ɗinka tufafi\",\n          \"gyara mota\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"quizQuestions\": [\n      {\n        \