mamawa\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"rashin aminci\",\n          \"faɗa\",\n          \"tsokana\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"track\": \"formal\",\n    \"targetAudience\": \"youth\",\n    \"gapTeaser\": null,\n    \"chainNext\": null,\n    \"isChainLeaf\": true,\n    \"useTodayPrompt\": null\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-socs-09\",\n    \"gradeband\": \"p2\",\n    \"subject\": \"Social Studies\",\n    \"subjectHa\": \"Nazarin Zamantakewa\",\n    \"moduleNumber\": 9,\n    \"titleEn\": \"Leaders in the Community\",\n    \"titleHa\": \"Shugabanni a Cikin Al’umma\",\n    \"titleAjami\": null,\n    \"ajami_validated\": false,\n    \"textExplanationHa\": \"Shugabanni a cikin al’umma mutane ne da suke taimaka wa jama’a su bi tsari. A gida, iyaye suna jagorantar yara. A makaranta, shugaban makaranta da malamai suna taimaka wa ɗalibai. A unguwa, ana iya samun mai unguwa ko dattijo da mutane suke saurara saboda kwarewa da ladabi. Shugaba mai kyau yana sauraren mutane, yana ƙarfafa zaman lafiya, kuma yana taimaka wa jama’a su kiyaye doka. Wannan darasi ba batun jam’iyya ba ne; yana koya maka ma’anar jagoranci cikin sauƙi. Ya kamata ka girmama shugabanni masu kyau, ka bi umarni na aminci, kuma ka faɗa wa babba idan wani umarni ya sa ka cikin haɗari. Kai ma za ka iya nuna jagoranci ta hanyar gaskiya, taimako, da ladabi. Ka sake duba misali a gida ko makaranta, sannan ka faɗa wa babba abin da ka koya.\",\n    \"textExplanationAjami\": null,\n    \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin Zamantakewa. Yau za mu koyi Shugabanni a Cikin Al’umma. [MAIN] Shugabanni a cikin al’umma mutane ne da suke taimaka wa jama’a su bi tsari. A gida, iyaye suna jagorantar yara. A makaranta, shugaban makaranta da malamai suna taimaka wa ɗalibai. A unguwa, ana iya samun mai unguwa ko dattijo da mutane suke saurara saboda kwarewa da ladabi. [PAUSE 1] Wa ke jagorantar yara a gida? [MAIN] Ka haɗa darasin da abin da kake gani a gida, makaranta, kasuwa, ko unguwa. Ka yi tunani a hankali, ka nuna ladabi, sannan ka tambayi babba idan kana bukatar ƙarin bayani. [PAUSE 2] Wane hali shugaba mai kyau yake nunawa? [OUTRO] Ka ci gaba da lura da rayuwar al’umma. Kyakkyawan hali yana taimaka maka ka zauna lafiya da mutane.\",\n    \"audioFile\": \"audio/p2-socs-09.mp3\",\n    \"imageCard\": \"images/p2-socs-09.png\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Wa ke jagorantar yara a gida?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"iyaye\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"iyaye\",\n          \"ƙwallo\",\n          \"hanya\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Wane hali shugaba mai kyau yake nunawa?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"sauraro\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"sauraro\",\n          \"tsokana\",\n          \"rashin gaskiya\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"quizQuestions\": [\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wa ke jagorantar yara a gida?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"iyaye\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"ƙwallo\",\n          \"hanya\",\n          \"kujera\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wa ke taimaka wa ɗalibai a makaranta?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"malamai\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"direbobi kawai\",\n          \"masu wasa\",\n          \"ƙananan yara\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane hali shugaba mai kyau yake nunawa?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"sauraro\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"tsokana\",\n          \"rashin gaskiya\",\n          \"faɗa kullum\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me shugaba mai kyau yake ƙarfafawa?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"zaman lafiya\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"hayaniya\",\n          \"ƙin doka\",\n          \"ɓata hanya\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Ta yaya yaro zai nuna jagoranci?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"taimako da ladabi\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"tsokana\",\n          \"ɓoye gaskiya\",\n          \"ƙin sauraro\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"track\": \"formal\",\n    \"targetAudience\": \"youth\",\n    \"gapTeaser\": null,\n    \"chainNext\": null,\n    \"isChainLeaf\": true,\n    \"useTodayPrompt\": null\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-socs-10\",\n    \"gradeband\": \"p2\",\n    \"subject\": \"Social Studies\",\n    \"subjectHa\": \"Nazarin Zamantakewa\",\n    \"moduleNumber\": 10,\n    \"titleEn\": \"Cooperation\",\n    \"titleHa\": \"Haɗin Kai\",\n    \"titleAjami\": null,\n    \"ajami_validated\": false,\n    \"textExplanationHa\": \"Haɗin kai yana nufin mutane su yi aiki tare domin cimma abu mai kyau. A gida, yara za su iya haɗa kai wajen gyara ɗaki ko tattara kayan wasa. A makaranta, ɗalibai za su iya haɗa kai wajen share aji, raba littattafai, ko taimaka wa wanda bai fahimta ba. A unguwa, mutane na iya haɗa kai wajen tsaftace hanya ko kula da wurin ruwa. Haɗin kai yana rage wahala saboda aiki yana rabuwa tsakanin mutane. Hakanan yana koya maka sauraro, hakuri, da girmama ra’ayin wasu. Idan kana aiki tare da abokai, kada ka yi umarni da fushi. Ka saurari kowa, ka yi naka ɓangare, ka kuma gode wa wanda ya taimaka. Al’umma mai haɗin kai tana samun zaman lafiya da ci gaba.\",\n    \"textExplanationAjami\": null,\n    \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin Zamantakewa. Yau za mu koyi Haɗin Kai. [MAIN] Haɗin kai yana nufin mutane su yi aiki tare domin cimma abu mai kyau. A gida, yara za su iya haɗa kai wajen gyara ɗaki ko tattara kayan wasa. A makaranta, ɗalibai za su iya haɗa kai wajen share aji, raba littattafai, ko taimaka wa wanda bai fahimta ba. A unguwa, mutane na iya haɗa kai wajen tsaftace hanya ko kula da wurin ruwa. [PAUSE 1] Me haɗin kai yake nufi? [MAIN] Ka haɗa darasin da abin da kake gani a gida, makaranta, kasuwa, ko unguwa. Ka yi tunani a hankali, ka nuna ladabi, sannan ka tambayi babba idan kana bukatar ƙarin bayani. [PAUSE 2] Me haɗin kai yake ragewa? [OUTRO] Ka ci gaba da lura da rayuwar al’umma. Kyakkyawan hali yana taimaka maka ka zauna lafiya da mutane.\",\n    \"audioFile\": \"audio/p2-socs-10.mp3\",\n    \"imageCard\": \"images/p2-socs-10.png\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Me haɗin kai yake nufi?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"aiki tare\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"aiki tare\",\n          \"yin faɗa\",\n          \"ɓoye kaya\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Me haɗin kai yake ragewa?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"wahala\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"wahala\",\n          \"taimako\",\n          \"zaman lafiya\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"quizQuestions\": [\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me haɗin kai yake nufi?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"aiki tare\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"yin faɗa\",\n          \"ɓoye kaya\",\n          \"ƙin magana\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane aiki ɗalibai za su iya yi tare?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"share aji\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"lalata aji\",\n          \"jefa littafi\",\n          \"tsokana\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me haɗin kai yake ragewa?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"wahala\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"taimako\",\n          \"zaman lafiya\",\n          \"farin ciki\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane hali ake bukata wajen haɗin kai?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"sauraro\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"fushi\",\n          \"rashin hakuri\",\n          \"raini\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me ya kamata ka yi wa wanda ya taimaka?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"gode masa\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"tsokane shi\",\n          \"mantawa da shi\",\n          \"ɓoye masa kaya\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"track\": \"formal\",\n    \"targetAudience\": \"youth\",\n    \"gapTeaser\": null,\n    \"chainNext\": null,\n    \"isChainLeaf\": true,\n    \"useTodayPrompt\": null\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-socs-11\",\n    \"gradeband\": \"p2\",\n    \"subject\": \"Social Studies\",\n    \"subjectHa\": \"Nazarin Zamantakewa\",\n    \"moduleNumber\": 11,\n    \"titleEn\": \"Nigerian Symbols\",\n    \"titleHa\": \"Alamomin Nijeriya\",\n    \"titleAjami\": null,\n    \"ajami_validated\": false,\n    \"textExplanationHa\": \"Alamomin Nijeriya abubuwa ne da suke tunatar da mu ƙasarmu. Misalai masu sauƙi su ne tutar Nijeriya, tambarin Nijeriya, taken ƙasa, kuɗin Nijeriya, da launukan kore da fari. Tuta tana da kore, fari, kore. Launin kore yana iya tunatar da mu noma da albarkatun ƙasa, fari kuma yana iya nuni da zaman lafiya. Kuɗin Nijeriya shi ne naira da kobo. Taken ƙasa waƙa ce da ake yi cikin girmamawa a wasu lokuta na makaranta ko taro. Ya kamata ka girmama alamomin ƙasa, kada ka lalata tuta ko wasa da kuɗi. Wannan darasi yana koya maka ka san abubuwan da ke nuna Nijeriya cikin sauƙi, ba tare da shiga siyasa ba. Ka sake duba misali a gida ko makaranta, sannan ka faɗa wa babba abin da ka koya.\",\n    \"textExplanationAjami\": null,\n    \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin Zamantakewa. Yau za mu koyi Alamomin Nijeriya. [MAIN] Alamomin Nijeriya abubuwa ne da suke tunatar da mu ƙasarmu. Misalai masu sauƙi su ne tutar Nijeriya, tambarin Nijeriya, taken ƙasa, kuɗin Nijeriya, da launukan kore da fari. Tuta tana da kore, fari, kore. Launin kore yana iya tunatar da mu noma da albarkatun ƙasa, fari kuma yana iya nuni da zaman lafiya. [PAUSE 1] Wane launi ne yake cikin tutar Nijeriya? [MAIN] Ka haɗa darasin da abin da kake gani a gida, makaranta, kasuwa, ko unguwa. Ka yi tunani a hankali, ka nuna ladabi, sannan ka tambayi babba idan kana bukatar ƙarin bayani. [PAUSE 2] Menene kuɗin Nijeriya? [OUTRO] Ka ci gaba da lura da rayuwar al’umma. Kyakkyawan hali yana taimaka maka ka zauna lafiya da mutane.\",\n    \"audioFile\": \"audio/p2-socs-11.mp3\",\n    \"imageCard\": \"images/p2-socs-11.png\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Wane launi ne yake cikin tutar Nijeriya?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"kore\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"kore\",\n          \"ruwan hoda\",\n          \"baki\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Menene kuɗin Nijeriya?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"naira\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"naira\",\n          \"dutse\",\n          \"ganye\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"quizQuestions\": [\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane launi ne yake cikin tutar Nijeriya?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"kore\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"ruwan hoda\",\n          \"baki\",\n          \"shunayya\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Menene kuɗin Nijeriya?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"naira\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"dutse\",\n          \"ganye\",\n          \"ƙwallo\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"T