{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_64","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"node -e \\\"const d=require('./tools/p6-batch/p6-socs-complete.json'); const q5=d.map(m=>m.quizQuestions[4].templateHa); const outros=d.map(m=>(m.audioScript.match(/\\\\\\\\[OUTRO\\\\\\\\] (.*)\"'$/u)||[])[1]); console.log('\"'unique Q5',new Set(q5).size+'/'+q5.length); console.log('unique OUTRO',new Set(outros).size+'/'+outros.length); for(const m of d) console.log(m.id,'Q5='+m.quizQuestions[4].templateHa,'OUTRO='+((m.audioScript.match(/\\\\\\\\[OUTRO\\\\\\\\] (.*)\"'$/u)||[])[1]||'\"'MISSING'));\\\"\"","aggregated_output":"unique Q5 15/15\nunique OUTRO 15/15\np6-socs-01 Q5=Me Nijeriya take iya bayarwa ga sauran duniya? OUTRO=Ka zaɓi kaya ko bayani ɗaya da ya ratsa ƙasashe, ka bayyana damarsa da ƙalubalensa ga Nijeriya.\np6-socs-02 Q5=Wace hanya ce babba zai iya bi domin neman gyaran tauye haƙƙi? OUTRO=Ka haɗa haƙƙi ɗaya da hanyar lumana da doka da za a bi domin neman gyara.\np6-socs-03 Q5=Me hidimar ɗan ƙasa da ƙwarewa ba su taƙaita gare shi ba? OUTRO=Ka ambaci sana’a ta halal ɗaya da yarinya za ta iya bi, sannan ka bayyana yadda ilimi yake taimaka mata.\np6-socs-04 Q5=Manufofin ci gaban duniya nawa ne? OUTRO=Ka tsara ƙaramin aikin makaranta da zai taimaka wa tattalin arziki, jama’a, da muhalli a lokaci ɗaya.\np6-socs-05 Q5=Me yake jagorantar hukuncin ƙarar zaɓe? OUTRO=Ka jera matakai daga rajista zuwa sanar da sakamako, sannan ka bayyana dalilin da ya sa jita-jita ba ta maye gurbin hujja ba.\np6-socs-06 Q5=Me ya kamata alƙali ya yi kafin hukunci? OUTRO=Ka zana taswirar hanyoyi masu rassa, ba tsani guda ba, ka sanya rawar kowace kotu da aka koya.\np6-socs-07 Q5=Ta yaya ɗalibi zai ƙarfafa haɗin kai? OUTRO=Ka ambaci aikin yau da kullum ɗaya da zai ƙara amincewa tsakanin abokan da suka bambanta.\np6-socs-08 Q5=Wace hukuma ce take taimakawa wajen kare ƴan gudun hijira? OUTRO=Ka kwatanta nau’ikan ƙaura biyu ta iyaka, dalili, da haƙƙin mutanen da abin ya shafa.\np6-socs-09 Q5=Me ya sa bai dace a yaɗa jita-jita a lokacin gaggawa ba? OUTRO=Ka maimaita matakai uku na aminci: nisanta, kada ka taɓa abin da ba ka sani ba, sannan ka sanar da amintaccen babba.\np6-socs-10 Q5=Me ya kamata ka yi kafin saka hoton wani? OUTRO=Ka duba ɗabi’arka ta intanet: kare kalmar sirri, tabbatar da bayani, neman izini, da girmama mutane.\np6-socs-11 Q5=Me ya sa ake nazarin mutanen koyi a wannan darasi? OUTRO=Ka zaɓi mutum ɗaya daga cikin biyar, ka bayyana gudunmawarsa da ƙaramin aikin da za ka kwaikwaya cikin doka.\np6-socs-12 Q5=Wane saƙo ne darasin bai bayar ba? OUTRO=Ka zaɓi hidima ɗaya a unguwa, ka nuna yadda bayanin yawan jama’a zai taimaka wajen tsara ta.\np6-socs-13 Q5=Me BOI take iya ba wasu masana’antu da sana’o’i bisa ƙa’idoji? OUTRO=Ka tsara ƙaramin ra’ayin sana’a: bukatar da zai biya, ƙwarewar da ake bukata, da yadda za ka rubuta kuɗi.\np6-socs-14 Q5=Waɗanne ƙwarewa ne ilimin zaman lafiya yake ginawa? OUTRO=Ka tsara aikin haɗin kai ɗaya da zai sa kowa ya samu rawa, a saurari ra’ayi, kuma a warware rashin fahimta da wuri.\np6-socs-15 Q5=Wace ƙwarewa ce za ta haɗa dukan P3 zuwa P6 a shirin sakandare? OUTRO=Ka zaɓi jigogi huɗu, ɗaya daga kowane aji uku zuwa shida, ka haɗa su cikin bayani ɗaya da aikin ɗan ƙasa mai yiwuwa.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
